    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d0cd95ccb1db9d2daaa5274",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "北部玄驹在东海帝王的施压下，\n虽然一度加快了步调，\n却又慢慢地调整回原本的节奏。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6191b067c936a45eae3fdaf56e8c724dd74650db9da5a5391ff9358b21ed40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
